OL,2,K                                       
OL,3,BSix fall into Aura River after         
OL,4,Bsuspension bridge collapses            
OL,5,GThe bridge had undergone repair work   
OL,6,Gonly last week.                        
OL,7,K                                       
OL,8,BDads on family leave face growing      
OL,9,Bdiscrimination worries                 
OL,10,GMore fathers are running into workplace
OL,11,Gproblems that mothers have faced for   
OL,12,Gyears.                                 
OL,13,K                                       
OL,14,BRussia retrieves burning cargo ship    
OL,15,Bfrom Gulf of Finland after drone strike
OL,16,GThe Sparta II ship was sailing to      
OL,17,GRussia's Baltic exclave of Kaliningrad 
OL,18,Gwhen it was struck by a drone, caught  
OL,19,Gfire, and drifted into Finland's       
OL,20,Gterritorial waters.                    
